Six of vangel76's PRs were squash-merged as empty commits because of a tooling error on our side, so none of their code reached main. This re-lands all six, integrated and tested together on today's main:

- #264 Clipboard pane
- #263 Table styles: every region, live preview, delete, custom styles first
- #270 Manage Styles
- #271 Asian Typography, kinsoku and mid-word Latin wrapping
- #267 Group and Ungroup
- #280 Shape Effects

It includes the integration fixes from review:
- table-style deletion unified across #263 and #270;
- Table Grid and Normal Table can't be deleted;
- shape effects also work inside groups, with a round-trip test;
- table-style regions merged into the `region_of`/`region_text` helpers from #287, so AutoFit (#291) measures styled text;
- charts and diagrams (#292) recognised by the drawing helpers, and Group refuses them;
- Serbian rows for every new string.

`cargo xtask ci` passes (fmt, clippy, test, assets, layers, wasm). All credit for the features goes to @vangel76. #306 is the author's own re-land of the same six; this version carries the integration fixes.

